* EMSC1 -- EDMSEC Annoyance Rank display screen
MAP EMSC1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER   AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=RED
  FIELD USERID   AT 2,20  LEN 8  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD RANKDSP  AT 4,20  LEN 2  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD MAXAUTH  AT 4,30  LEN 4  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD LASTVIOL AT 5,20  LEN 10 PROT DIM    COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD VIOLCDSP AT 5,40  LEN 4  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD STATUSF  AT 6,20  LEN 1  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD MESSAGE  AT 8,5   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD FOOTER   AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
